# Virtual copies.
variants.create = Kurema kopi y’ikoranabuhanga…
variants.rename = Guhindura izina rya kopi y’ikoranabuhanga…
variants.delete = Gusiba kopi y’ikoranabuhanga
variants.close = Funga iyi foto na kopi zayo z’ikoranabuhanga mbere yo kuzimura cyangwa kuzisiba.
variants.saved_hint = Kopi ishingira ku byahinduwe byabitswe, cyangwa ku mwimerere niba nta byahinduwe bihari. Banza ubike ibyahinduwe bitarabikwa.
variants.move_original = Imura ifoto y’umwimerere kugira ngo kopi zayo z’ikoranabuhanga na zo zimuke.
variants.protected_export = Hitamo ahandi ho kubika. Amafoto yoherejwe avuye mu bubiko bw’amafoto ntashobora gusimbura ifoto y’umwimerere cyangwa aho ibyahinduwe byayo bibikwa.
